cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Если вы используете ruTS в исследованиях или программах, пожалуйста, сошлитесь на библиотеку."
title: "ruTS, a library for statistics extraction from texts in Russian"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shkarin
    given-names: Sergey
    email: kouki.sergey@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/SergeyShk/ruTS"
url: "https://sergeyshk.github.io/ruTS/"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22837587
version: 0.14.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
keywords:
  - russian
  - nlp
  - text statistics
  - readability
  - lexical diversity
  - stylometry
  - corpus linguistics
abstract: "ruTS computes text statistics for Russian: basic counts, readability formulas, lexical diversity and sophistication, morphological, syntactic, cohesion, phonetic and style statistics, corpus measures and stylometry, with spaCy components, datasets and visualizations."
